{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bockstein spectral sequence of RP^2 at p = 2: tracing H^2(RP^2; Z) = Z/2\n  stable from page 2: i_2 is injective in every degree, so k_2 = 0, d_r = 0 and E_r = E_2 for every r >= 2 (E_inf = E_2)\n  a = [1] (canonical coordinates in Z/2; cocycle e2)\n    r = 1: j_1(2^0 a) = [1] in E_1^2 = Z/2; in ker d_1, in im d_1^1: = d_1 [1]\n    r = 2: j_2(2^1 a) = 0 in E_2^2 = 0; in ker d_2, zero (so in im d_2^1)\n  reduced: cells 1 1 1 -> 1 1 1 (unit pivots cancelled; f g = 1, 1 - g f = dh + hd and both chain maps checked on every cell)\n  check: d o d = 0 (14), d maps relations to relations (2), chain map commutes with d (6), induced map well defined (24), exact (36), short exact (degree) (3), snake lemma lift (2), stable page: d = 0, next page equal (3), reduction: f g = 1, 1 - g f = dh + hd, chain maps (1)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "bockstein_trace", "ucas": "bockstein RP^2 mod 2 trace 2 [1]", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "bockstein_trace", "space": "RP^2", "p": 2, "degree": 2, "H": "Z/2", "stable_page": 2, "traces": [{"coordinates": "[1]", "cocycle": "e2", "pages": [{"page": 1, "degree": 2, "element": "[1]", "group": "Z/2", "zero": false, "in_ker_d": true, "in_im_d": true, "preimage": "[1]"}, {"page": 2, "degree": 2, "element": "0", "group": "0", "zero": true, "in_ker_d": true, "in_im_d": true}]}], "reduced": {"cells_before": [1, 1, 1], "cells_after": [1, 1, 1]}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "d o d = 0", "points": 14, "passed": true, "text": "d o d = 0: verified 14 times"}, {"kind": "d maps relations to relations", "points": 2, "passed": true, "text": "d maps relations to relations: verified 2 times"}, {"kind": "chain map commutes with d", "points": 6, "passed": true, "text": "chain map commutes with d: verified 6 times"}, {"kind": "induced map well defined", "points": 24, "passed": true, "text": "induced map well defined: verified 24 t